ase of lovastatin induced rhabdomyolysis</article-title><source>Korean J Med</source><year>1996</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>846</fpage><lpage>850</lpage></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><fig id="F1" orientation="portrait" position="float"><label>Fig. 1</label><caption><p>Bone scans show a diffuse soft tissue uptake in right pelvis and both lower legs.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="enm-28-331-g001"/></fig></floats-group></article>